#: ../../tools/ensembl_sequence_tools.rst:32 caf273f75ed941dc9e8eb1fc0f3e9d08
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get the amino acid or nucleotide sequence for an Ensembl"
" ID (protein, transcript, or gene). Retrieves protein sequences from ENSP"
" IDs, cDNA/CDS from ENST IDs, or genomic DNA from ENSG IDs. Example: "
"ENSP00000269305 returns the 393 amino acid protein sequence of TP53 "
"canonical isoform. ENST00000269305 with type='cdna' returns the 2512 bp "
"cDNA sequence of TP53-201."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/ensembl_sequence_tools.rst:34
#: ../../tools/ensembl_sequence_tools.rst:68 4795a385dc47462d8aaea482568accca
#: 66617448b0cc411b91dbc1e6e33c2f94
msgid "**Parameters:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/ensembl_sequence_tools.rst:36 d263dc337f6b490889382ba8de2eb5f7
msgid ""
"``ensembl_id`` (string) (required) Ensembl stable ID. Examples: "
"'ENSP00000269305' (TP53 protein, 393 aa), 'ENST00000269305' (TP53-201 "
"transcript), 'ENSG00000141510' (TP53 gene). Protein IDs start with ENSP, "
"transcript with ENST, gene with ENSG."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/ensembl_sequence_tools.rst:39 b5c2f10e63d1477d9b084726823d8930
msgid ""
"``type`` (string) (optional) Sequence type to return. Options: 'protein' "
"(amino acid), 'cdna' (spliced cDNA), 'cds' (coding sequence), 'genomic' "
"(unspliced DNA). Default: 'protein' for ENSP IDs, auto-detected for "
"others."
msgstr ""

